    "detailed_description": "Play as a cute mini elf,<br>Start an adventure in a human city.<br><br>The game uses an open world,<br>Each city can accommodate up to 4,000 players simultaneously.<br><br>Huge human city, Convenience store, coffee house, street vendor<br>Use the unique mini-elf point of view to shuttle between the crowds<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000800/extras/bda28a8044b2acaa57c39585bf3ad146.avif?t=1701334198\" /></div><br><br>Player in the game<br>The main goal is to Capture, Cultivate, and then direct the various beetles to fight.<br><br>Can catch a variety of world-renowned beetles<br>And each beetle has a three-stage growth change.<br>Give players more nurturing and evolution of fun.<br><br>And in the game, you can beetles fighting at any time with people.<br>All Calculation are performed in the server, there is no cheat space.<br><br>Of course, besides the beetles fighting,<br>Players can also explore in the city. Challenge all kinds of powerful BOSS.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000800/extras/0c8e39fb05896c93cb96dd4df6e978a8.avif?t=1701334198\" /></div><br><br>Although beetle fighting is the main goal of the game,<br>But you can outside of the beetle battle,<br>Find a place to be green. Cultivate a variety of flowers and plants.<br><br>Harvesting various plants<br>In addition to allowing your beetles to eat a meal,<br>Can also be made into a variety of potions that can strengthen the properties of beetles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000800/extras/aecf7f0b5477bf171df2a24b722efee4.avif?t=1701334198\" /></div><br><br>Incarnate into a cute elf,<br>In a huge city.<br>Began to be the king of beetles!",
